<title>SRI LANKA: Development Finance Q1 net up 29 pct.</title>
<headline>Development Finance Q1 net up 29 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(millions of Sri Lankan rupees unless specified)</p>
<p>    Net profit				119 vs  92</p>
<p>    Income				    643 vs  554</p>
<p>    Net from operations		   196 vs  131</p>
<p>    Other income				2 vs    1</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  198 vs  132</p>
<p>    Tax (provision)			  79 vs   40</p>
<p>Note - Development Finance Corp of Ceylon Ltd is one of two development finance institutions listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
